{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"abfd36d06a42b0948da8986a5bb3b827debf14df78f6f44479aed120f274b7eb","ja":"ロコのやりたいこと","zh":"ROCO想做的事","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1d97254b6aee29d0ea43da6a1719f730a4b443b876e260ffa9c7443708723236","ja":"5人で作品づくりか……すごくいいね！\nロコちゃん、どんなアートを作りたいの？","zh":"5个人一起创作作品啊……真棒呢！\nROCO，你想创作什么样的艺术呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"babb9304446f9f39d47b5c4c184d4665cc6565f786e34f271735cc80d58bbfb2","ja":"はい♪　ロコが今、一番作り上げたいアートは……\nカラフルポップなアイドル魚拓です！","zh":"好的♪　ROCO现在最想创作的艺术……\n就是色彩缤纷、流行可爱的偶像鱼拓！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"92b5fdbcb52e3e2e5b405301a31ada829c6381fc2fbee5d9f8f22cf8ce56cc00","ja":"………………えっ！？\nえ～っと、それって……？","zh":"………………咦！？\n那个～，也就是说……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d08ce39b69d4b7a6b6f4f6d41f4de957b1b0d040172223ed22c7258e7146308b","ja":"驚くのも、無理はないです。\nアイドルインダストリーではレアなアートですから。","zh":"感到吃惊也是在所难免的。\n毕竟在偶像界，这也是罕见的艺术呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"80a741a89bf29d864b951a67a7dce0257e0d3a3a19b6ebf4c79efcd861380b74","ja":"みんなの体に、ロコがイメージするカラーのペンキを\n塗って、紙に転写するんです！","zh":"在大家的身上涂上ROCO所联想到的颜色的油漆，\n然后再印到纸上！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"3c479ea2889fde7afb3d9755ada6d04e4b855ca06db5ae4daeadcb47b4df3279","ja":"みんなの等身大アートを残すんですよ！","zh":"要把大家的等身大艺术保留下来哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ad5de7b6df66d137b072b1b1aaae3ea30e984061f049e19c7db96073f38fa569","ja":"なるほど！　ボディラインとか、\n結構リアルに表現されちゃいそうね……。","zh":"原来如此！身材线条什么的，\n感觉会被相当写实地表现出来呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3aaf1de6da9d5d9872afe567de8021cef4ef636f02ed876a8a0348da1256c035","ja":"お姉さんのセクシーの見せ所だわ、うふふっ♪","zh":"正是展现大姐姐性感魅力的好机会呢，呵呵♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"0477b454732c54fa9857972550c6852d5532c2d29bfe1dfdd313e4b14ac39c21","ja":"ええっ！？　そ、それはちょっと……\nすごく恥ずかしいかも……。","zh":"诶！？这、这有点……\n感觉会非常害羞啊……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"f4de4df513e31b07f3eb660527b9b9106ab34322c57ce1b1a2b8af1235157bf2","ja":"私も困ります。\nボディラインには、あまり自信がないので……。","zh":"我也很为难。\n因为我对自己的身材曲线并不是很有自信……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"26a0dc4b556d56462ae009edea5e2b59a4ca6c9a7373251addcf612044fef531","ja":"わ、私もちょっと……。","zh":"我、我也稍微有点……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"bddac42d3b21727d7e190b8dfccd8f2521ee84990bf72a42aed8a39d5e6180a3","ja":"あ、あら？　みんなには、\nちょっと早かったかしら……？","zh":"哎，哎呀？对大家来说，\n是不是稍微早了一点呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"57733d3ceed860e55c543451cff155aa5ff521febcc96dddf6a464258557f0ad","ja":"そ、そうですね！　まだ早……\nい、いえ、多分大人になっても、それは……。","zh":"也是呢！现在还太……\n不、不对，就算长成大人，那也大概……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"de31358ce483b5a41595d6863ac3cc80ae481fe31b4d66ca4864dff026b61fa2","ja":"あ、天の声さんのカンペです！","zh":"啊，是画外音先生的提示板！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"461853e830b991b748c74bec07ee54c673a53c265348ae41c87a69857d4d8a96","ja":"「時間もおしてるし、次のテーマに行ってください」\nということなので、次のテーマは……。","zh":"“时间也挺赶的，请进入下一个主题吧”\n对方都这么说了，那么下一个主题是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"1d75d5e350bc6d85a4c0bff83a5e1072e160666c5dc9aa9bca919f502a0e564d","ja":"う、ウェイトです！　どうして、\n「検討します」も言ってもらえないんですか！？","zh":"等、请等一下！为什么\n连一句“我们会考虑的”都不肯对我说呢！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1534.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"81f3c8b7e523ef1cd5b8301cf63e4bf8c77131e5d29815598bb842440de6ca0b","ja":"ロコのドリームも\n叶えてください～～～っ！！","zh":"请把ROCO的梦想\n也一起实现吧～～～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
